{"id":"f9fa657af9512258","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-density-matrix.md","title":"Density Matrix","display":"df-density-matrix — Density Matrix","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-density-matrix","aliases":["58-df-density-matrix","Density Matrix"],"display":"df-density-matrix — Density Matrix","depends_on":["[[58-df-positive-operator]]","[[58-df-trace-class]]","[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-density-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-density-matrix</span><span>Density Matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-density-matrix — Density Matrix"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0bb7c1368e3c7b0\" href=\"?note=c0bb7c1368e3c7b0\" title=\"58-df-positive-operator\">58-df-positive-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cb6f3da63e39a685\" href=\"?note=cb6f3da63e39a685\" title=\"58-df-trace-class\">58-df-trace-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis\">../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\mathcal H,B,t,I,e\\in V\">\\(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B,t,I,e\\in V\\)</span> (operator, Hilbert structure, trace value, and orthonormal-basis data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B)\\)</span> (Hilbert-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\)</span> (trace-class predicate with its Hilbert structure explicit, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cb6f3da63e39a685\" href=\"?note=cb6f3da63e39a685\" title=\"58-df-trace-class\">58-df-trace-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis\">../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PositiveOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PositiveOperator}_S\\)</span> (positive operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c0bb7c1368e3c7b0\" href=\"?note=c0bb7c1368e3c7b0\" title=\"58-df-positive-operator\">58-df-positive-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S\\)</span> (operator trace relation and density-matrix predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}trace} \\vdash \\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(t,\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\\land t=\\sum_{i\\in I}B(\\rho(e(i)),e(i))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}trace} \\vdash \\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(t,\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\\land t=\\sum_{i\\in I}B(\\rho(e(i)),e(i))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}density\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\mathrm{PositiveOperator}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H)\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(1,\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}density\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\mathrm{PositiveOperator}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H)\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(1,\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Density matrix: state in quantum mechanics encoding mixed states</li>\n<li>Positivity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho \\geq 0\">\\(\\rho \\geq 0\\)</span> ensures probabilities; the explicit orthonormal-basis trace relation supplies normalization without a free trace-functional symbol.</li>\n<li>Entanglement entropy: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(\\rho) = -\\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho \\log \\rho)\">\\(S(\\rho) = -\\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho \\log \\rho)\\)</span>; von Neumann entropy</li>\n<li>Reduced density: partial trace over subsystem; defines entanglement structure</li>\n<li>Expectation values and pure states should be separate atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nielsen and Chuang, Quantum Computation and Quantum Information</li>\n<li>Holevo, Statistical Structure of Quantum Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-positive-operator","status":"resolved","id":"c0bb7c1368e3c7b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-positive-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-trace-class","status":"resolved","id":"cb6f3da63e39a685","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-trace-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis","status":"resolved","id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B)$ (Hilbert-space predicate, see [[58-df-hilbert-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-trace-class","status":"resolved","id":"cb6f3da63e39a685","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)$ (trace-class predicate with its Hilbert structure explicit, see [[58-df-trace-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis","status":"resolved","id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-positive-operator","status":"resolved","id":"c0bb7c1368e3c7b0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PositiveOperator}_S$ (positive operator predicate, see [[58-df-positive-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho,\\mathcal H,B,t,I,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PositiveOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}operator\\text{-}trace} \\vdash \\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(t,\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)\\land t=\\sum_{i\\in I}B(\\rho(e(i)),e(i))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}density\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)\\land\\mathrm{PositiveOperator}_S(\\rho,\\mathcal H)\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(1,\\rho,\\mathcal H,B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho \\geq 0","display":false},{"tex":"S(\\rho) = -\\operatorname{Tr}(\\rho \\log \\rho)","display":false}],"bytes":2276,"backlinks":[{"id":"a4239c0a6290ab42","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-412","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-density-matrix.md|58-df-density-matrix]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["c0bb7c1368e3c7b0","cb6f3da63e39a685","b70ce791d5b1a19b","bb0e606138cd791a"]}